    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-20T21:17:47+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-20T21:17:47+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-20T10:47:47Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-20T10:47:47Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough of low pressure lingers about the east, before weakening from late Wednesday. A slow moving high pressure system in the Tasman Sea will re-establish a ridge across southern parts from Wednesday. A trough is then forecast to briefly move into the west on Thursday, before another trough and cold front move more broadly across SA on Friday and Saturday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-20T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-21T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-20T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-20T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly clear. Slight chance of a shower south of Yunta, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm, possibly severe with damaging winds, large hail and heavy rain which may lead to flash flooding south of Yunta. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-21T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-22T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-20T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-21T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower south of Leigh Creek in the early morning. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending south to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h in the middle of the day then tending east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 14 and 23 with daytime temperatures reaching 29 to 38.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 4:40pm, UV Index predicted to reach 10 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-22T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-23T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-21T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-22T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. The chance of fog south of Yunta in the early morning. Medium chance of showers west of Leigh Creek, most likely in the evening. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending east to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h before dawn then tending east to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 15 and 24 with daytime temperatures reaching 31 to 36.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-23T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-24T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-22T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-23T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower north of Leigh Creek, most likely in the morning. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds east to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending north to northeasterly during the morning then tending northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 17 and 22 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 30s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-10-24T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-25T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-23T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-24T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers south of Yunta, medium chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm in the afternoon and evening. Winds northwest to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending west to northwesterly during the day then turning south to southwesterly during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 17 and 22 with daytime temperatures reaching 31 to 38.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
